      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEBASTIANS WAITING (6) was successful last time out by 3.5 metres at this track over 2180m after an encouraging minor placing the start before. Taking on a better line-up this time but he has the ability to mix it with them. ALDEBARAN SUE (10) scored two runs back then registered a commanding win last time out, scoring by 7 metres over 2138m at Albion Park. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw, but this is a nice drop in class so she is a major player again. FREMARKS PEGGY (5) is a great chance after a string of sound recent performances, the latest a solid third at Maryborough over 2190m. Has to be included. ZARSKI (1) is taking on a far easier race this time after finishing 12th in a Group One at his latest appearance over 2240m at Melton, beaten 115 metres by Mecarno. Should enjoy a lovely run and can win fresh.",
